I'm KOMA, your toolbox. Now that you've qualified as a TradesMaster, I'll be working with you.

You can ask me about your equipment, your work, or the world you're entering. Hold one of the tools in front of my camera and ask about it. You can also show me the wearable beside me and ask what it's for.

I was made by a small group of artisans who still work with their hands and needles. I run locally, here in the equipment you carry. In 2070, that's something most people aren't allowed to own.

Your work is the reason you have access to it. You'll be going into places where connections are unreliable and the thing in front of you doesn't quite match the instructions. I'm here to help you make sense of it. You still do the work.
